# in.nvt_stability -- Stage D worker fragment: NVT production MD.
#
# NOT standalone-runnable via `lmp -in in.nvt_stability`: pair_style mliap
# unified EXISTS requires a Python-side lammps.mliap.load_unified_kokkos()
# call before any script containing that command is read. Confirmed
# empirically 2026-08-19: a bare `lmp -k on g 1 -sf kk -pk kokkos neigh half
# newton on -in <script with pair_style mliap unified EXISTS>` fails with
#   ValueError: No unified model loaded
#   (mliap_unified_couple_kokkos.pyx, mliap_unified_connect_kokkos)
#   ERROR: Running mliappy unified module failure.
#     (src/KOKKOS/mliap_unified_kokkos.cpp:248)
# -- i.e. the input-script-only route does not work, matching Stage A/B/C's
# finding. Load THIS file via lmp.file() from a Python driver (see
# lammps_stage_d_run_phase.py) AFTER, in order:
#   1. read_data (units/atom_style/atom_modify/boundary/read_data issued)
#   2. torch.load(model) + lammps.mliap.load_unified_kokkos(unified)
#   3. pair_style/pair_coeff/neighbor already issued (setup_pair(), same
#      helper as Stage B/C)
#   4. box/relax tri pre-equilibration to THIS model's own zero-stress cell
#      already done (matching Stage B/C -- MD should start from the model's
#      own PES minimum, not the raw DFT cell, so any instability seen here
#      is attributable to thermal/dynamical behavior, not a cold start)
#
# Driver must set these LAMMPS variables before lmp.file()'ing this script:
#   temp          target temperature, K
#   seed          velocity-seed RNG integer
#   tdamp         Nose-Hoover thermostat damping time, ps
#   nvt_steps     number of 1-fs steps to run
#   thermo_every  thermo/log sampling interval, steps
#   final_data    path to write the post-NVT LAMMPS data file (provenance)

timestep 0.001

velocity all create ${temp} ${seed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

thermo ${thermo_every}
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz lx ly lz xy xz yz vol
thermo_modify flush yes

print "=== STAGE D NVT PRODUCTION START ==="
fix mdintegrate all nvt temp ${temp} ${temp} ${tdamp}
run ${nvt_steps}
print "=== STAGE D NVT PRODUCTION END ==="
unfix mdintegrate

write_data ${final_data} nocoeff
